SUMMARY:Lit up by the bay
DESCRIPTION:We are a welcoming small group of men and women of varied ages 
 who meet monthly to discuss the book of the month we have chosen earlier f
 rom a list of 3 put forward by a member. Our eclectic palette alternates f
 rom fiction\, non-fiction and a broad definition of classics. We don't tre
 at the books with great academic rigour\, but do discuss style\, appeal\, 
 content etc. If you like reading then this is a great group for you.
